JOINT and histology analysis — WuLab, 2026

Bayes_Joint.m adapts Bayesian sampling code credited to Oscar Jalnefjord
(2018-08-27); halfSampleMode.m originates from the same implementation.
Public upstream source, distributed under Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/OSIPI/TF2.4_IVIM-MRI_CodeCollection/tree/main/src/original/fitting/OJ_GU

The JOINT adaptation uses the JOINT forward model with parameters fin,
diameter, Dex, Din and kin, and JOINT-specific prior inputs. Original author
attribution is retained in the source files.
